        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Loader, Roger Michell, Daphne du Maurier\n- Companies: Free Range Films\n- Products: My Cousin Rachel, The Mother, Enduring Love, Venus, Hyde Park on Hudson, Le Week-end\n- Topics: film and television production, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Since 1996, Kevin Loader and co-owner Roger Michell have run the London-based production company Free Range Films.\n- Kevin Loader is a British film and television producer.\n- Through Free Range Films, Kevin Loader and Roger Michell made several Roger Michell-directed feature films, including The Mother, Enduring Love, Venus, Hyde Park on Hudson, and Le Week-end.\n- Daphne du Maurier wrote the 1951 novel My Cousin Rachel.\n- My Cousin Rachel is a 2017 romantic drama film written and directed by Roger Michell, and it is based on Daphne du Maurier's 1951 novel of the same name.",
